/-!
# First-row witnesses for the ten native generators

The 1024 candidate products have distinct first rows. Balanced lookup tables
record these untrusted rows and their inverse indexing; `Independence` checks
every recurrence and transports the result to the native group representation.
The row order agrees literally with `Words.generators`.
-/

